 "remarks": "Location, lifestyle, and convenience in the heart of Westport! Welcome to 67 Saugatuck Avenue, a beautifully renovated 3-bedroom, 1-bath residence offering the perfect blend of modern comfort and an unbeatable location. This inviting unit features updated finishes throughout, bright living spaces, and the added benefit of in-unit laundry. Enjoy the best of Westport living with restaurants, coffee shops, boutiques, and local favorites just moments from your doorstep. Spend your weekends exploring the vibrant Saugatuck neighborhood, strolling along the waterfront, enjoying Westport's beautiful beaches, or taking advantage of the town's incredible shopping, dining, and entertainment. With convenient access to the Westport train station and I-95, commuting to Stamford, Norwalk, or New York City is a breeze. Available as a yearly, unfurnished rental. *Bedroom and bathroom counts differ from municipal tax records. Tenant and tenant's agent to independently verify all information.* No pets.",
